{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53880","headline":"缺题 二 · 杜牧","name":"缺题 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我昔造其室，羽仪鸾鹤翔。\n交横碧流上，竹映琴书牀。\n出俗无近语，尧舜禹武汤。\n（见宋朱长文《吴郡图经续记》卷下）（按：此诗仅存两段，未全。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}